WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.334 line:0%
And finally, New Rule,

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.804 line:0%
It's time to admit
President Trump has actually
accomplished one good thing.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:07.507 line:0%
He's ruined the phrase,
"thoughts and prayers" forever.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.975 line:0%
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.212 line:0%
(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.615 line:0%
Of course, the problem with
"thoughts and prayers"

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:18.618 line:0%
has always been that thoughts
are the opposite of prayers.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.454 line:0%
-(LAUGHTER)
-One is from-- (LAUGHS)

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:25.457 line:0%
One is from the Enlightenment
and one is from<i> The Exorcist.</i>

00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:27.293 line:0%
(ANA CHUCKLES) Oh, my God.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:31.731 line:0%
But it wasn't until Trump
tweeted his thoughts and prayers
after the Parkland shooting

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.633 line:0%
and one of the survivors
tweeted back,

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:38.204 line:0%
"I don't want your condolences
you fucking piece of shit...
Prayers won't fix this,"

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:42.075 line:0%
that "prayer" officially
became an eye roll.

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:44.844 line:0%
Yes, America's finally
getting it.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.745
Prayer doesn't work,
'cause if it did,

00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:49.048
every drug test
would come back clean,

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:50.583
-and there'd be--
-(ANA CHUCKLES)

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.084
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.620
(SCATTERED APPLAUSE)

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.222
And there'd be no need
for the morning-after pill.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:57.890
-(LAUGHTER)
-(ANA CHUCKLES)

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.325
But it's more than just prayer.

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:01.494
Thanks to Trump, piety itself

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:05.098
has ceased to be a third rail
in American politics.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.634
How could it anymore,
when the world's least Godly man

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:12.838
has been so fully embraced
by our most religious people,
the Evangelicals?

00:01:13.138 --> 00:01:15.208
Oh, they love them
some Donald Trump,

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:18.044
a man who's been to church
four times in his whole life,

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.579
three of them to get married.

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.548
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:25.585
(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.056
The only time he touches a Bible
is for depositions-- (CHUCKLES)

00:01:31.356 --> 00:01:34.560
(LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE)

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:36.262
And if he ever went
to confession,

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.864
they'd have to take
a meal break.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.767
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.404
He-- (CHUCKLES) He's into golden
showers, not the golden rule.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.006
(AUDIENCE GROANS)

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.741
-(CHEERING)
-(ANA GIGGLES)

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:50.310
-(APPLAUSE)
-It's...

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.311
It's true.

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:55.147
He does not tweet people
the way he wants to be tweeted.

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:57.016
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:59.885 --> 00:02:02.755
So when Trump got his mulligan
from the values voters,

00:02:02.855 --> 00:02:06.826
that's when we knew religion
had jumped the shark,
and it was finally safe to say,

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:09.362
"None for me, thanks,
I had bullshit for lunch."

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:12.731
Look at some of
these recent examples.

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:13.766
Billy Graham.

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.637
My entire life, I've watched
presidents from both parties
suck up to this blowhard,

00:02:18.737 --> 00:02:20.573
like he was the American Gandhi,

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.675
but when he died last month,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.811
it got covered
like Olympic curling.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.814
"Local storyteller dead at 99."

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:32.051
Omarosa, last week,
openly mocked Mike Pence

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:35.522 line:0%
for believing Jesus
"tells him to say things."

00:02:36.188 --> 00:02:37.523 line:0%
Mocked by Omarosa?

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:39.659 line:0%
It's like getting dumped on
by Kevin Hart.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.895 line:0%
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:48.867 line:0%
Even Oprah was widely
made fun of when she said,

00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:52.338 line:0%
"God, if you think I'm supposed
to run for president,
you gotta tell me,

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.508 line:0%
and it has to be so clear
that not even I can miss it."

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:58.210 line:0%
And a lot of America said,
"Oh, please,

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:02.048 line:0%
not the, 'I have to check
with my imaginary friend'
excuse."

00:03:02.749 --> 00:03:05.618 line:0%
Which was bad enough when
people like Scott Walker said,

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:08.153 line:0%
"I am certain:
This is God's plan for me."

00:03:08.587 --> 00:03:11.891 line:0%
Something God also told
Rick Perry, Rick Santorum,

00:03:12.124 --> 00:03:15.728
Ben Carson, Michelle Bachmann,
Herman Cain, Sarah Palin...

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.498
God is a nice guy,
but he doesn't follow politics.

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:21.601
(LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE)

00:03:24.703 --> 00:03:26.572
But, folks, this is progress.

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.008
I used to be
a lonely pioneer here,

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:32.311
calling religious thinking
a neurological disorder, but...

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.880
now, it's like anal,
everyone's doing it.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.883
(LAUGHTER)

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:41.554
And in that, there is a lesson
for the Democrats.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.490
Things that used
to be third rails

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.892
don't have
to be third rails forever.

00:03:47.259 --> 00:03:48.594
Republicans get that.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.630
For 50 years their fundamental
principles were,

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:54.533
"Law enforcement, good,
Russia, bad."

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:56.869
And then, it was<i> Freaky Friday.</i>

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.670
(LAUGHTER)

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:03.375
Twenty years ago,
the idea of arming teachers
was universally derided.

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:05.378
But now,
while we point and laugh,

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:06.478
they're doing it!

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.381
Democrats, on the other hand,

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:10.482
begin every
gun conversation with,

00:04:10.582 --> 00:04:12.118
"I support
the Second Amendment."

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:13.152
(SCOFFS)

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:16.655
'Cause they fear this is
one of those third rails
that can never be touched.

00:04:16.922 --> 00:04:18.457
Even shooting victims,

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:20.926
the minute they wake up
from their coma,
their first words are,

00:04:21.026 --> 00:04:22.729
"I still support
the Second Amendment."

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:25.397
Now, would it be a hard slog

00:04:25.497 --> 00:04:28.467
to change the public's mind
on guns? Of course.

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.904
But a hard slog
never fazes Conservatives.

00:04:32.505 --> 00:04:34.607
Ronald Reagan used to be a joke.

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:36.109
Now, he's an airport.

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:39.412
(LAUGHTER)

00:04:40.445 --> 00:04:42.448
(SCATTERED APPLAUSE)

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:46.485
The Second Amendment is
just words humans made up

00:04:46.585 --> 00:04:49.388
at a certain moment in History
when they felt right.

00:04:49.488 --> 00:04:51.557
It's an Amendment,
not a Commandment.

00:04:51.757 --> 00:04:54.426
-And we could make up--
-(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)

00:04:54.626 --> 00:04:56.262
(WHISTLING)

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.766
And we could make up
new words again.

00:05:00.866 --> 00:05:05.204
Instead of, "The right of
the people to keep and bear arms
shall not be infringed,"

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:09.541 line:0%
we could change it to,
"The right of the people
to apply for the privilege

00:05:09.641 --> 00:05:14.780 line:0%
of possessing non-military style
weaponry, as long as
they're not bat-shit crazy,

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.483 line:0%
-shall not be infringed."
-(CHEERING AND APPLAUSE)

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:20.186 line:0%
Sorry, Trump, no guns for you.
All right!

